      "review_description": "Alex, Mel and the team were superb for us throughout. They were the only company who came out to site to quote, which worked well for us as we had a few unique constraints. Pricing was competitive and they took the time to talk through our situation to ensure we were getting what was right for us. They worked with us on alternate location for the solar panels, were flexible with an install date to suit us, installation was fine with a friendly and communicative crew and followed up after install to ensure all was well. Very appreciative of their work.",
