      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Alex spent time with us to understand what we were trying to achieve with the extension to our solar power. Despite the change in suppliers they managed the process of procurement, came back with a different approach that in the end gave us a better answer for about the same money.  We already had an adequate array and this gave us panels that give us another couple of hours and enough battery to charge our electric car even on a cloudy day. They were responsive to questions and issues and flexible when it came to the timing of the install so that our busy schedules were not interupted.  Please note that we have just upgrateded a system that is 4 years old and the review of Great White is primarily about the upgrade but they have been looking after the system for us for a couple of years.",
