      "review_description": "Great White Solar are on the ball. They provided me a number of options for my battery, gave me sound advice and came on site before finalising the quote. Everyone I dealt with was pleasant and quick to respond. The installation ran into a bit of trouble with my soft walls and the installer picked it up, changed plans, fetched some extra materials and completed the job by the end of the day. I got the feeling they really knew what they were doing and they wanted me to be totally satisfied with my system. A week later I get a follow up call, checking in on how the system was working. But no problems at all, the system is doing exactly what they said it would. Very Happy with GWS.",
