      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Through SolarQuotes we were put in touch with Great White Solar in Macksville, NSW.Alex, the operations manager, came to visit at our property for an assessment after an initial quote based on a telephone conversation. Alex was personable and took his time to fully assess the house, setting and consider the sun's tracking across the roof over the course of a year. He tweaked the initial quote to increase the number of panels and decrease the size of the battery. We selected a suitable undercover space for the battery.At the day of installation 4 friendly & polite guys arrived: Matt, Luke, Simon and Jamo were a great team. The atmosphere between them felt good, an important one, as it makes you feel confident that there is a team that flows together and are confident with the job at hand. Since it was a sizeable job (14.48 kW in Aiko panels with a 24.18 kWh Sigengery battery) it took them 2 full days to set the system up. They gave good instructions at the end and left everything spotless. Thank you everyone at Great White Solar!",
